# Raw secret value, one line, no KEY= prefix — this is the file
# services.lldap.settings.ldap_user_pass_file points at
# (modules/lldap.nix), used to set LLDAP's own bootstrap admin password
# the first time it starts. Generate a real one with: openssl rand -hex 16
REPLACE-ME-WITH-A-REAL-SECRET-AT-LEAST-8-CHARS
